-- An act that reads a section GIVEN declared in an imported file, readers.l4,
-- directly and through a rule of that file. The act is untried, as one
-- reading the file's own section GIVEN is (explore-actions/section-given.l4),
-- and the reason names readers.l4: this file cannot supply `rate` with a
-- WITH, which gets check/not-a-function here (review of
-- smucclaw/l4-ide#1107).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT readers

DECLARE Actor IS ONE OF Alice
DECLARE Act IS ONE OF
    pay HAS amount IS A NUMBER

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`direct` MEANS PARTY Alice MUST pay rate WITHIN 10 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"

GIVETH A DEONTIC Actor Act
`via rule` MEANS PARTY Alice MUST pay `the window` WITHIN 10 HENCE FULFILLED LEST BREACH BY Alice BECAUSE "late"
